  "content": "![banner](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rosevcook/heart_crystals/main/src/main/resources/logo.png)\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">\n  <a title=\"Blueprint\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftinyurl.com%2Fycyjpbeb&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Blueprint\"></a>\n  <a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/6uRtghgWnE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/780149719611473930?color=E2005C&amp;label=%20&amp;labelColor=AA0021&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a title=\"Github\" href=\"https://github.com/rosevcook/heart_crystals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Team_Galena?label=&amp;color=E2005C&amp;labelColor=AA0021&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github\"></a>\n</p>\n<h3>📖 关于模组：</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>心之水晶是一个受《泰拉瑞亚》启发的模组，在地下添加了稀有的心形水晶供你探索发现。使用这些水晶将永久为你增加一颗心。</li>\n  <li>进入新世界时你将拥有 5 颗心，通过努力可以提升至最多 20 颗心。这两个数值均可自由配置。</li>\n  <li>心之水晶还可以被制作成多种物品，例如心形灯笼、丘比特之箭、再生药水，并且可用作盔甲纹饰材料。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📖 联动内容：</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/caverns-and-chasms\">Caverns & Chasms</a> - 心形灯笼配方将包含银锭，心之水晶碎片为活性肉块提供新的替代配方</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gallery\">Gallery</a> - 心跳绘画的物品纹理</li>\n</ul>",
